{"seq":3,"slug":"model-evaluation-adversarial","title":"模型评估与对抗漂移：标签稀缺、precision@k 与 evasion 防范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/model-evaluation-adversarial","wordCount":2903,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型评估与对抗漂移-标签稀缺-precision-k-与-evasion-防范\">模型评估与对抗漂移：标签稀缺、precision@k 与 evasion 防范</h1><p>一个图模型离线报告 AUC 0.97，上线后调查队列里 95% 的告警是误报——这不是罕见事故，而是反欺诈评估的标准失败模式。根因有三：欺诈标签天生稀缺且延迟到账（拒付与 chargeback 的最终结果常在交易后 120 天才成熟）；调查团队的上限是<strong>每天能看多少条</strong>，而非模型能排多准；攻击者会主动读你的模型并通过拆散共享资源、稀释度数来规避。本篇讨论这三个约束下的评估方法：ROC-AUC 为何骗人、标签稀缺下如何构造可信标签、如何把精度锚定到运营容量、以及如何量化对抗漂移并设计防 evasion 的回测与灰度。上游特征与决策链路见 <a href=\"graph-features-embedding\">图特征工程与嵌入</a> 与 <a href=\"rules-scoring-decision-engine\">规则+模型评分决策引擎</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-roc-auc-会骗人\">核心概念：为什么 ROC-AUC 会骗人</h2><p>欺诈样本占比常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级——每 10 万笔交易里几十笔欺诈。ROC 曲线的两个轴（TPR 与 FPR）都<strong>不含先验概率</strong>，因此在极度不平衡下会把「在 1% FPR 上抓到一半欺诈」这种业务上毫无用处的模型渲染成 AUC 0.99。Saito 与 Rehmsmeier 2015（<em>PLOS ONE</em> 10(3):e0118432）系统论证：正类稀少时 ROC 曲线给出乐观印象，而 PR 曲线对同类模型差异敏感得多，应优先用 PR-AUC。Davis 与 Goadrich 2006（ICML）证明 PR 空间与 ROC 空间一一对应。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>在反欺诈中的陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROC-AUC</td>\n<td>随机取一对正负样本，正样本排前的概率</td>\n<td>被海量负类淹没，数值虚高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR-AUC</td>\n<td>不同召回下的精度加权平均</td>\n<td>无容量语义，不直接对应队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>precision@k</td>\n<td>排前 k 个告警里有多少真欺诈</td>\n<td>依赖 k；k 大于调查容量即空谈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lift@k</td>\n<td>抓到的欺诈率相对基线提升倍数</td>\n<td>需要稳定的基线欺诈率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准误差（ECE/Brier）</td>\n<td>预测概率与真实频率是否一致</td>\n<td>阈值编排依赖校准，失校即漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程纪律是：<strong>离线看 PR-AUC 与 precision@k，线上看实际告警精度与队列积压</strong>，ROC-AUC 仅作粗筛。同时必须显式记录评估所用的<strong>标签成熟窗口</strong>——用「7 天内已确认」与用「120 天后终局」的标签评估，模型排序可能完全相反。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  L[标签源&lt;br/&gt;拒付/投诉/调查裁决] --&gt; M[标签成熟窗口&lt;br/&gt;censoring]&#10;  M --&gt; S[时间切分&lt;br/&gt;purged + embargo]&#10;  S --&gt; E[评估器]&#10;  E --&gt; P1[PR-AUC / ROC-AUC]&#10;  E --&gt; P2[precision@k / lift@k&lt;br/&gt;k = 队列容量]&#10;  E --&gt; P3[代价敏感期望损失]&#10;  P1 --&gt; R[上线门控]&#10;  P2 --&gt; R&#10;  P3 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; SH[影子模式&lt;br/&gt;champion-challenger]&#10;  SH --&gt; MON[漂移监控&lt;br/&gt;PSI/KS/ADWIN]&#10;  MON --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n  L[标签源&lt;br/&gt;拒付/投诉/调查裁决] --&gt; M[标签成熟窗口&lt;br/&gt;censoring]\n  M --&gt; S[时间切分&lt;br/&gt;purged + embargo]\n  S --&gt; E[评估器]\n  E --&gt; P1[PR-AUC / ROC-AUC]\n  E --&gt; P2[precision@k / lift@k&lt;br/&gt;k = 队列容量]\n  E --&gt; P3[代价敏感期望损失]\n  P1 --&gt; R[上线门控]\n  P2 --&gt; R\n  P3 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; SH[影子模式&lt;br/&gt;champion-challenger]\n  SH --&gt; MON[漂移监控&lt;br/&gt;PSI/KS/ADWIN]\n  MON --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"标签稀缺-延迟标签-pu-学习与弱监督\">标签稀缺：延迟标签、PU 学习与弱监督</h2><p>欺诈标签的第一个属性是<strong>延迟且删失（censored）</strong>：拒付在交易后 30–120 天才能终局，且大多数被拒交易永远不会被调查，因此它们的标签是「未知」而非「正常」。把未知当负类训练，等于在教模型「没被抓到的就是好人」——这正是合成身份团伙最想要的偏置。Dal Pozzolo 等 2015（<em>Expert Systems with Applications</em>）指出，标签延迟与验证滞后会系统性高估离线表现，必须按<strong>标签可用时间</strong>而非交易时间对齐。</p>\n<p>处理标签稀缺的三条主线：</p>\n<p><strong>PU 学习（positive-unlabeled）。</strong> Elkan 与 Noto 2008（KDD）证明，在「已确认正类 + 未标注样本」的数据上，只要未标注数据里正类比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 已知，就能无偏估计分类器输出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>π</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{g}(x) = \\frac{P(s=1 \\mid x)}{\\pi} = \\frac{P(s=1 \\mid x)}{P(s=1 \\mid y=1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「被标注」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「真实欺诈」，正类是已确认的 bust-out 账号与已定案拒付。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 无法直接观测，实践中用<strong>已确认欺诈率的下界</strong>从调查覆盖率反推，并随置信区间一起上报。</p>\n<p><strong>弱监督与标注函数。</strong> 与其等终局标签，不如把多个<strong>不精确但快</strong>的信号当标注函数：调查员初判、规则命中、跨账号图谱共现、客服工单标记。Snorkel 式框架（Ratner 等，2017，VLDB）通过学习各标注函数在少量真标签上的精度与相关性生成概率标签。合成身份场景尤其适用：「被捕的团伙」与「被投诉的账号」是两个独立弱信号，合并后覆盖率远高于任一单独来源。</p>\n<p><strong>代理标签与主动学习。</strong> 用可观测的中间结果作代理——设备批量注册、共享支付工具数量、首次拒付——把「最终欺诈」拆成可验证的阶段目标。主动学习把有限标注预算投向模型分歧最大的样本，优先标注<strong>高风险社区成员</strong>而非孤立账号，因为一个社区标签能同时修正数十个节点。</p>\n<p>两个必须防的坑：<strong>标签泄漏</strong>（用交易后才知道的设备变更、账号冻结记录作特征）与<strong>标签污染</strong>（攻击者故意制造小额正常交易对冲风险画像）。前者用时间切分加大清洗窗（purge + embargo）解决，后者靠标签来源分级——攻击者自控行为的信号权重必须低于第三方与调查裁决信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"precision-k-把精度锚定到调查容量\">precision@k：把精度锚定到调查容量</h2><p>调查团队每天能复核的告警数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是硬约束：10 名调查员、每人每天 15 条，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>precision@k</strong> 度量「排前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的告警里真欺诈占比」，是唯一与这个约束直接对齐的指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Lift@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision@}k = \\frac{1}{k} \\sum_{i=1}^{k} y_{(i)}, \\qquad \\text{Lift@}k = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{k} y_{(i)} / k}{\\bar{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lift@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6146em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7858em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型按分数降序排列后第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位的真实标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是总体欺诈率。Lift@k 对基线欺诈率做了归一——基线 0.1% 时 precision@150 达到 20% 意味着 200 倍提升，比 PR-AUC 更能说服业务方。</p>\n<p>更严格的做法是<strong>代价敏感评估</strong>。放行真实欺诈损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（退款 + 商品 + 物流），误拦正常用户损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（客服成本 + 转化下降），人工复核损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（调查员工时），期望损失为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Loss</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mtext>Alerts</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Alerts</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{Loss}] = C_{FN} \\sum_{i \\notin \\text{Alerts}} y_i + C_{FP} \\sum_{i \\in \\text{Alerts}, y_i = 0} (1 - y_i) + C_R \\cdot k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Loss</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"llap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0651em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Alerts</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Alerts</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>阈值编排即在容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 下最小化该期望（见 <a href=\"rules-scoring-decision-engine\">规则+模型评分决策引擎</a>）。评估纪律是<strong>在固定告警率上回测</strong>而非固定阈值：阈值随分数分布漂移，固定告警率才可比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估方式</th>\n<th>结论对象</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量排序（PR-AUC）</td>\n<td>模型整体判别力</td>\n<td>直接当作上线收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>precision@k</td>\n<td>给定容量下的队列质量</td>\n<td>k 取值脱离真实人力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定告警率回测</td>\n<td>版本间可比性</td>\n<td>忽略告警率本身漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价敏感期望损失</td>\n<td>业务净收益</td>\n<td>代价系数从不更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对抗漂移-evasion-poisoning-与概念漂移\">对抗漂移：evasion、poisoning 与概念漂移</h2><p>反欺诈模型面对一个<strong>会读你输出的对手</strong>。三类漂移须分开治理：</p>\n<p><strong>Evasion（逃避，测试时）。</strong> 攻击者改变自身特征以躲避检测。Zügner、Akbarnejad 与 Günnemann 2018（KDD）的 Nettack 证明，仅允许<strong>加边/删边/改特征</strong>的少量扰动，就能把目标节点推到错误类别，且这些扰动常来自实际可控行为——多注册几个正常账号与目标共享设备即可改变其度数与邻居分布。合成身份团伙的对策正是「拆散共享资源」：不再共用设备指纹，改用分散的住宅代理与虚拟卡 BIN 轮换。</p>\n<p><strong>Poisoning（投毒，训练时）。</strong> Zügner 与 Günnemann 2019（KDD）的 Metattack 用元学习生成投毒图，直接降低模型在目标节点上的表现。生产上的对应是<strong>注入正常行为数据</strong>：先经营一批「干净」账号再变现。</p>\n<p><strong>Concept drift（概念漂移）。</strong> 合法用户行为本身在变（大促期间批量下单、跨境物流延迟推高拒付率），使「正常」的定义漂移。这不是攻击，但同样让阈值失效。</p>\n<p>评估对抗鲁棒性靠<strong>扰动回测</strong>：对测试图施加预算约束下的边扰动（每节点加/删 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 条边），观测 precision@k 的下降幅度，即量化「规避成本」。Bifet 与 Gavaldà 2007（SDM）的 ADWIN 通过自适应窗口比较两个子窗口均值，在分布变化时给出显式告警；工程上并行维护 PSI 与 KS 统计量，超阈值即触发重训评估。关键是<strong>把漂移检测的假阳性也计入成本</strong>——过度敏感的重训会引入不稳定版本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T[训练图快照 T0] --&gt; ADV[扰动回测&lt;br/&gt;加边/删边预算 Δ]&#10;  ADV --&gt; M1[precision@k 下降曲线&lt;br/&gt;= 规避成本]&#10;  M1 --&gt; G{下降超阈值?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H1[纳入对抗训练&lt;br/&gt;或提高图特征权重]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H2[维持]&#10;  LIVE[线上流量] --&gt; D1[PSI / KS]&#10;  LIVE --&gt; D2[ADWIN&lt;br/&gt;标签率序列]&#10;  D1 --&gt; G&#10;  D2 --&gt; G&#10;  H1 --&gt; RT[影子重训]&#10;  RT --&gt; CH[champion-challenger&lt;br/&gt;仅当胜出才替换]\">flowchart TD\n  T[训练图快照 T0] --&gt; ADV[扰动回测&lt;br/&gt;加边/删边预算 Δ]\n  ADV --&gt; M1[precision@k 下降曲线&lt;br/&gt;= 规避成本]\n  M1 --&gt; G{下降超阈值?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H1[纳入对抗训练&lt;br/&gt;或提高图特征权重]\n  G --&gt;|否| H2[维持]\n  LIVE[线上流量] --&gt; D1[PSI / KS]\n  LIVE --&gt; D2[ADWIN&lt;br/&gt;标签率序列]\n  D1 --&gt; G\n  D2 --&gt; G\n  H1 --&gt; RT[影子重训]\n  RT --&gt; CH[champion-challenger&lt;br/&gt;仅当胜出才替换]</pre><h2 id=\"线上验证-影子模式-反事实评估与模型治理\">线上验证：影子模式、反事实评估与模型治理</h2><p>离线指标再好也不能直接上线。三段式验证解决这个问题：<strong>影子模式</strong>让新模型在线上并行打分但不产生动作，用真实流量获得无偏的 precision@k 估计；<strong>champion-challenger</strong> 在小比例流量上做真动作对比；<strong>反事实/离策略评估</strong>（IPS 或 Doubly Robust，Dudík、Langford 与 Li 2011，ICML）估计被替换策略的收益，但必须处理<strong>动作偏差</strong>——只有被执行动作的结果被观测到，未执行的高风险账号结局缺失，直接比较会系统高估保守策略。</p>\n<p>模型治理不是形式主义。美联储 SR 11-7 与 OCC 2011-12《模型风险管理指引》要求模型开发、验证、使用三方分离，验证独立于开发，上线后持续监控，重大变更需重新验证。ISO/IEC 42001 与 EU AI Act（Regulation (EU) 2024/1689）把<strong>信用评估</strong>列为高风险场景，Annex III 义务自 2026 年 8 月起适用——欺诈检测多属「安全组件」，但一旦影响授信或账户关闭，即落入受监管的自动决策范围。GDPR 第 22 条与 CFPB Circular 2023-03 要求此类决定可解释、可申诉，故评估报告须保留<strong>理由码到结构特征的回溯链</strong>（如「该设备关联 47 个账号，其中 6 个已确认欺诈」）。公平性检查须与精度评估同时进行：EEOC《统一指南》（29 CFR 1607）的<strong>四分之五法则</strong>是通用 disparate impact 筛查，若某受保护群体通过率低于最高群体的 80%，即需举证业务必要性；按群体切片计算 FPR 与 precision@k，总体 precision 高不代表对跨境卖家群体不高误报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>极度不平衡下 <strong>ROC-AUC 会系统性乐观</strong>，主评估指标应是 PR-AUC 与 precision@k（Saito &amp; Rehmsmeier 2015；Davis &amp; Goadrich 2006）。</li>\n<li>标签稀缺的根因是<strong>延迟与删失</strong>；用 PU 学习、弱监督标注函数与代理标签扩充监督信号，并把标签成熟窗口写进评估契约（Elkan &amp; Noto 2008；Dal Pozzolo 等 2015）。</li>\n<li>精度必须锚定到<strong>调查容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></strong>；用固定告警率回测保证版本可比，用代价敏感期望损失连接业务净收益。</li>\n<li>对抗漂移要<strong>分型治理</strong>：evasion 用 Nettack/Metattack 式扰动回测量化规避成本，concept drift 用 ADWIN 与 PSI/KS 监控，重训走影子模式与 champion-challenger。</li>\n<li>上线验证需处理动作偏差（IPS/DR），治理需满足 SR 11-7、ISO/IEC 42001、EU AI Act 与 GDPR 第 22 条的可解释与可申诉要求，并做四分之五法则的公平性切片。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>评估的终点不是给出一个分数，而是回答三个可运营的问题：<strong>每天能抓到多少、误伤多少、对手要花多大代价才能躲开</strong>。这三个答案汇入处置与合规链路，见 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规处置</a>；标签来源分级依赖 <a href=\"../identity-graph-resolution/entity-resolution-linking\">实体解析与身份链接</a> 的置信度模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型评估与对抗漂移：标签稀缺、precision@k 与 evasion 防范","id":"模型评估与对抗漂移-标签稀缺-precision-k-与-evasion-防范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么 ROC-AUC 会骗人","id":"核心概念-为什么-roc-auc-会骗人"},{"level":2,"text":"标签稀缺：延迟标签、PU 学习与弱监督","id":"标签稀缺-延迟标签-pu-学习与弱监督"},{"level":2,"text":"precision@k：把精度锚定到调查容量","id":"precision-k-把精度锚定到调查容量"},{"level":2,"text":"对抗漂移：evasion、poisoning 与概念漂移","id":"对抗漂移-evasion-poisoning-与概念漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"线上验证：影子模式、反事实评估与模型治理","id":"线上验证-影子模式-反事实评估与模型治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规则+模型评分决策引擎：阈值编排、实时/离线链路与动作路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/rules-scoring-decision-engine"},"next":{"title":"告警分诊与案件管理：队列分级、SLA 与调查工作台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/investigation-ops-compliance/alert-triage-case-management"}}